    "diagnosis": "Mastocytoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "A 12-week-old boy presented with an isolated 12&nbsp;mm red-brown nodule on his right temple. A punch biopsy at higher magnification shows large polygonal cells with abundant lightly eosinophilic cytoplasm and round to oval nuclei, admixed with a few eosinophils. An occasional mitotic figure is present.",
