    "diagnosis": "Mastocytoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "A 12-week-old boy presented with an isolated 12&nbsp;mm red-brown nodule on his right temple. A punch biopsy with positive immunohistochemical staining for tryptase confirmed that the neoplastic cells were mast cells.",
