    "fileId": 21839,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Maculopapular cutaneous mastocytosis&nbsp;/ urticaria pigmentosa",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Yellow patches were noted on the left forearm of a 1-year-old boy. Punch biopsy shows a perivascular infiltrate of mast cells in the papillary dermis.",
